    basic: 'Prioritize dumping your middle-rank cards (7, 8, 9) early. These cards are the most likely to be forced into capturing sum combinations on the table.',
    intermediate: "The 'High Card Shield': Keep your face cards (J, Q, K) for as long as possible. Since they only capture other face cards by rank match, they are the 'safest' way to discard to the table without being forced to take a pile.",
